<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Cross-Cycle Track Record', description: 'Navigating four major economic regimes with zero debt defaults across market cycles.' }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<main class="flex-grow">
  
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-16 sm:py-20 border-b border-brand-navyLight">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-navyLight border border-brand-gold/40 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold mb-4">
          <span>Cross-Cycle Stress Testing</span>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight mb-2">
          Navigating Four Market Cycles
          <span class="block text-brand-gold text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-normal mt-2">Cross-Cycle Investment Record</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-slateLight leading-relaxed mt-4">
          Anyone can look smart during a bull market. The real test is surviving crashes without losing capital. We've steered capital through four major market disruptions without a single debt default.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Metrics Strip -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-brand-navyLight grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-white">4</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slateLight uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Economic Regimes</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-brand-gold">Zero</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slateLight uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Debt Defaults</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-white">100%</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slateLight uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Fixed-Rate Debt Mandate</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-brand-gold">100%</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slateLight uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Partner Capital Aligned</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Four Market Regimes Timeline -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-brand-cream border-b border-brand-linen">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="space-y-12">
        
        <!-- Regime 1: 2008 Financial Crisis -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-brand-linen shadow-sm relative card-hover">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-brand-linen gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold">Regime I</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mt-1">The Great Financial Crisis</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex self-start sm:self-auto px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-navy">
              2008 – 2011
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Market Context</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Global credit freeze. Subprime debt collapsed. Banks failed, and foreclosures swept the nation.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Investment Defense</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Held 100% fixed long-term mortgages. Maintained 12-month operating cash buffers. Refused all adjustable debt.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Outcome</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-ink font-semibold leading-relaxed">
                Zero debt defaults. Capital stayed safe while over-leveraged competitors went into liquidation.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Regime 2: 2014-2020 Tech & Real Estate Boom -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-brand-linen shadow-sm relative card-hover">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-brand-linen gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold">Regime II</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mt-1">Zero-Rate Expansion & Tech Boom</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex self-start sm:self-auto px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-navy">
              2014 – 2020
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Market Context</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Ten years of near-zero interest rates. Tech multiples reached 50x revenues. Real estate buyers took aggressive floating debt.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Investment Defense</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Strict acquisition discipline: capped real estate purchases at 75% of replacement cost and rejected overpriced seed rounds.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Outcome</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-ink font-semibold leading-relaxed">
                Strong cash distributions and protected basis. Avoided the painful 80% valuation write-downs that later hit tech.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Regime 3: 2020 Pandemic Dislocation -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-brand-linen shadow-sm relative card-hover">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-brand-linen gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold">Regime III</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mt-1">The Pandemic Liquidity Shock</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex self-start sm:self-auto px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-navy">
              2020 – 2021
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Market Context</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Fastest market drop in modern history. Businesses closed. Cities locked down overnight.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Investment Defense</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Cashed in pre-funded crash-put options (+800% gains) during the March panic to generate immediate liquidity.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Outcome</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-ink font-semibold leading-relaxed">
                Deployed fresh cash into discounted physical assets while other funds scrambled for emergency capital.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Regime 4: 2022-2026 Rapid Rate Shock -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-brand-linen shadow-sm relative card-hover">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-brand-linen gap-2">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold">Regime IV</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mt-1">The 500 bps Rapid Rate Shock</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex self-start sm:self-auto px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen text-xs font-mono font-bold text-brand-navy">
              2022 – 2026
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6">
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Market Context</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Fastest rate hike in 40 years. Debt costs surged from 3% to 8%, stranding floating-rate borrowers.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Investment Defense</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
                Zero floating debt exposure. Swept cash collateral into 5% Treasury bills and generated 12–15% cash yield via options overlays.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-xs uppercase font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Outcome</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-ink font-semibold leading-relaxed">
                Zero capital calls and zero defaults, delivering steady cash yield while peers faced distress and recapitalizations.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Diligence CTA -->
  <section class="py-14 bg-white text-center border-b border-brand-linen">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Review our Underwriting Checklists</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted mb-6">See the exact 1-page diligence matrices our Investment Committee enforces.</p>
      <a href="/diligence" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-brand-navy text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-brand-navyLight transition-colors">
        <span>View Institutional Tear-Sheets &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
